• Oil-filled transformer room.\r
• Switch gear room.\r
• Boiler room.\r
• Storage space for fuel or other highly flammable substance(s).\r
• Room that houses a fixed internal combustion engine."""@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ficr:SpaceUsage ;
    owl:disjointWith ficr:ServiceUsage,
        ficr:Warehouse .

